{"seq":1,"slug":"emergence-flocking","title":"涌现与群体行为","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/crowd-simulation-flocking/foundations/emergence-flocking","wordCount":1766,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"涌现与群体行为\">涌现与群体行为</h1><p>1986 年，Craig Reynolds 在做一件当时看来不太可能的事：让计算机里的一群鸟自己飞成鸟群，而他不为任何一只鸟规划航线。结果是著名的 Boids——每只鸟只看身边几个邻居、只遵守三条简单规则，整群却涌现出转向、分裂、绕障、重新汇合的复杂队形。这件事之所以重要，不在于动画好看，而在于它示范了一个深刻的原理：<strong>整体的复杂秩序可以完全由个体的局部规则生成，无需中心控制，也无需任何个体掌握全局信息</strong>。这个原理就是涌现（emergence），它是本 hub 一切算法的理论地基。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>涌现指的是系统在宏观层面表现出的性质，无法从单个组件的性质直接推断出来，只在大量组件交互时才&quot;长&quot;出来。鸟群的&quot;队形&quot;在单只鸟身上根本不存在——它没有&quot;队形&quot;这个变量，它只有&quot;远离最近的邻居&quot;&quot;朝邻居平均朝向转&quot;&quot;向邻居中心靠&quot;这三条本地规则。队形是这些规则在群体尺度上的副产品。</p>\n<p>群体模拟里有四个紧密相关的概念需要先厘清，它们常被混用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>在群体模拟中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>涌现 (Emergence)</td>\n<td>宏观性质无法还原为微观规则的简单叠加</td>\n<td>解释&quot;为什么&quot;局部规则能生成整体秩序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自组织 (Self-organization)</td>\n<td>系统无外部指挥自发形成有序结构</td>\n<td>涌现的动力学机制，强调&quot;无中心&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>群集智能 (Swarm intelligence)</td>\n<td>简单个体的集体表现出&quot;智能&quot;行为</td>\n<td>把涌现用于求解问题（如蚁群寻路）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>局部性 (Locality)</td>\n<td>个体只感知有限邻域，不读全局状态</td>\n<td>涌现成立的前提，也是可扩展性的来源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这四者的关系可以这样理解：局部性是前提，自组织是过程，涌现是结果，群集智能是把这个结果当工具来用。下图勾勒了从个体规则到整体行为的因果链条。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[个体: 仅感知局部邻域] --&gt; B[每个个体应用&lt;br/&gt;同一套简单规则]&#10;    B --&gt; C[个体间持续局部交互]&#10;    C --&gt; D[微观涨落被放大或抑制]&#10;    D --&gt; E[宏观有序结构涌现&lt;br/&gt;队形/流向/分层]&#10;    E -.反馈影响.-&gt; C&#10;    F[无中心控制器] -.缺席.-&gt; E\">flowchart TD\n    A[个体: 仅感知局部邻域] --&gt; B[每个个体应用&lt;br/&gt;同一套简单规则]\n    B --&gt; C[个体间持续局部交互]\n    C --&gt; D[微观涨落被放大或抑制]\n    D --&gt; E[宏观有序结构涌现&lt;br/&gt;队形/流向/分层]\n    E -.反馈影响.-&gt; C\n    F[无中心控制器] -.缺席.-&gt; E</pre><h2 id=\"为什么局部规则足够\">为什么局部规则足够</h2><p>一个自然的疑问是：每只鸟只看几个邻居，信息这么少，怎么可能协调出整群的行为？答案藏在&quot;交互的传递性&quot;里。鸟 A 跟着邻居 B 调整，B 又跟着 C 调整，扰动像波一样在群体里传播。当一只边缘的鸟因为发现捕食者而急转，这个信息不需要广播给全群——它通过一圈圈邻接关系，在几十毫秒内传遍整群。研究椋鸟群的物理学家发现，真实鸟群中每只鸟大约稳定地关注 6 到 7 个邻居（拓扑距离而非物理距离），这个&quot;拓扑交互&quot;使得群体在被拉伸时仍保持凝聚，是群体抗扰动的关键。</p>\n<p>局部性还带来一个工程上极宝贵的性质：<strong>可扩展性</strong>。如果每个 agent 都要和全体其他 agent 交互，计算量是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，一万个 agent 就是一亿次交互，无法实时。但若每个 agent 只与邻域内的少数个体交互，配合空间划分（网格或四叉树）把找邻居的成本降到近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，总成本就回落到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这正是后面 <a href=\"../practice/crowd-performance\">人群性能与实例化</a> 能把规模做到十万级的根本原因——它建立在涌现的局部性之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"微观与宏观两种视角\">微观与宏观两种视角</h2><p>同一群人群，可以从两个完全不同的尺度去建模，这条分野贯穿整个 hub。<strong>微观视角</strong>把每个 agent 当作独立个体，逐个计算它受到的力或速度，Boids、社会力模型、RVO 都属于此类；优点是个体行为细腻、易加入异质性，缺点是个体数大时成本高。<strong>宏观视角</strong>把整片人群当作连续的密度场和速度场，像流体一样用偏微分方程求解整体流动，<a href=\"../crowds/continuum-crowds\">连续介质人群</a> 是代表；优点是规模无关、流动自然，缺点是丢失个体细节。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    S[一群智能体] --&gt; M[微观: 逐个体]&#10;    S --&gt; A[宏观: 连续场]&#10;    M --&gt; M1[Boids 三规则]&#10;    M --&gt; M2[社会力模型]&#10;    M --&gt; M3[RVO/ORCA]&#10;    A --&gt; A1[连续介质人群]&#10;    A --&gt; A2[势场/流场导航]&#10;    M -.大规模时融合.-&gt; H[分层/混合方案]&#10;    A -.需个体细节时融合.-&gt; H\">graph TD\n    S[一群智能体] --&gt; M[微观: 逐个体]\n    S --&gt; A[宏观: 连续场]\n    M --&gt; M1[Boids 三规则]\n    M --&gt; M2[社会力模型]\n    M --&gt; M3[RVO/ORCA]\n    A --&gt; A1[连续介质人群]\n    A --&gt; A2[势场/流场导航]\n    M -.大规模时融合.-&gt; H[分层/混合方案]\n    A -.需个体细节时融合.-&gt; H</pre><p>值得强调的是，这不是非此即彼的选择。现代大规模人群系统往往混合两者：用宏观场决定大方向的人流，用微观规则处理近距离的避让。这个&quot;宏观定流向、微观防碰撞&quot;的分工，在 <a href=\"../crowds/density-flow-control\">密度与流量控制</a> 和分层导航里会反复出现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"群体行为的可观测特征\">群体行为的可观测特征</h2><p>要判断一个群体模拟&quot;对不对&quot;，不能只靠眼睛觉得好看，得有可量化的特征。研究者总结出几个标志性指标。<strong>极化度</strong>（polarization）衡量群体朝向的一致程度，定义为所有个体速度单位向量的平均模长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi = \\frac{1}{N}\\left|\\sum_{i=1}^{N} \\hat{v}_i\\right|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.8em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.8em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1800\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v600 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-600 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v600 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.65em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.8em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.8em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1800\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v600 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-600 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v600 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.65em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示高度一致地行进，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi \\to 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 表示朝向杂乱。<strong>角动量</strong>衡量群体绕质心旋转的程度，旋涡状的鱼群角动量高。<strong>最近邻距离分布</strong>反映群体的疏密与是否发生不真实的重叠。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>直觉含义</th>\n<th>在调参中的作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>极化度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>大家朝向是否一致</td>\n<td>对齐权重过高 → <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span> 饱和到 1，群体僵硬</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>凝聚度</td>\n<td>群体是否抱团不散</td>\n<td>聚合权重过低 → 群体逐渐解体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最近邻距离</td>\n<td>个体间是否保持间距</td>\n<td>分离权重过低 → 出现穿模重叠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>角动量</td>\n<td>是否形成旋涡/环流</td>\n<td>调参可在&quot;列队&quot;与&quot;打旋&quot;间切换</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些指标的妙处在于：它们都是宏观涌现量，你无法直接设定它们，只能通过调整微观规则的权重间接影响它们。这恰恰是涌现的本质——你设计的是规则，收获的是行为。掌握&quot;调微观参数、看宏观指标&quot;的反馈回路，是做好群体模拟的核心手艺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>涌现是本 hub 的理论地基：整体的复杂秩序由个体的简单局部规则生成，无中心控制、无全局信息。</li>\n<li>局部性既是涌现成立的前提，也是可扩展性的来源——只与邻域交互让总成本从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 回落到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>群体可从微观（逐个体）或宏观（连续场）两种尺度建模，二者常混合：&quot;宏观定流向、微观防碰撞&quot;。</li>\n<li>群体行为有可量化特征（极化度、凝聚度、最近邻距离、角动量），但它们是涌现量，只能靠调微观参数间接影响。</li>\n<li>理解涌现后，接下来 <a href=\"boids-model\">Boids 三规则模型</a> 会把这套思想落成最经典的三条向量规则。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章下一篇：<a href=\"boids-model\">Boids 三规则模型</a>——涌现思想的第一个具体算法。</li>\n<li>本章 <a href=\"steering-behaviors\">转向行为</a>——把局部规则抽象成可组合的操控力。</li>\n<li>跨库：群集智能用于单体寻路的另一面，见 <a href=\"../../game-ai/pathfinding/graph-search-basics\">游戏 AI · 图搜索基础</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"涌现与群体行为","id":"涌现与群体行为"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么局部规则足够","id":"为什么局部规则足够"},{"level":2,"text":"微观与宏观两种视角","id":"微观与宏观两种视角"},{"level":2,"text":"群体行为的可观测特征","id":"群体行为的可观测特征"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"Boids 三规则模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/crowd-simulation-flocking/foundations/boids-model"}}